### 人工判题测试

### 1. 获取待判列表
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/judge/pending-list
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "practiceId": 1,
  "classId": 1
}

### 1.2 获取待判列表
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/judge/pending-list
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "practiceId": null,
  "classId": 1
}

### 2. 获取提交详情
GET http://localhost:8084/api/learning/judge/submission/3

### 3. 判题操作
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/judge/submission
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "submissionId": 1,
  "questions": [
    {
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "score": 5,
      "maxScore": 10,
      "answerText": "class"
    },
    {
      "sortOrder": 2,
      "score": 3,
      "maxScore": 5,
      "comment": "true"
    }
  ]
}

### 提交练习测试

### 1. 提交练习答案
POST http://localhost:8084/api/learning/submission/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: 1

{
  "practiceId": 1,
  "studentId": 1,
  "answers": [
      "public class Main { public static void main(String[] args) { System.out.println(\"Hello World\"); } }",
      "Java的面向对象特性包括封装、继承和多态。"
  ]
}
